/_jfTV94jMEWkTEPV_jPMuMipJAPqCZT_N8OPfDfDj3w\"/><figcaption>（微博 / @雅典娜liya）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（微博 / @雅典娜liya）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230819/769539583904845824631852.jpeg/WxbIcGJBm-et73Qot3jybrIulWI35xTdJLrQviS60L4\"/><figcaption>（微博 / @雅典娜liya）</figcaption></figure><p>不爽手機被沒收！印16歲弟秒暴走　突轉頭「全家面前服毒」抽搐亡</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T10:42:48.485243+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1633,"images":31,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}